Package: EEVV
Title: Ingest and Harmonize Colombia's Vital Statistics (EEVV) Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Eduardo", "Alfonso-Sierra", , "edalfon@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6430-5135"))
Description: Downloads, ingests, and harmonizes microdata from Colombia's
    DANE Estadisticas Vitales (EEVV): Nacimientos (births), Defunciones
    Fetales (fetal deaths), and Defunciones No Fetales (general deaths).
    Variable coding is inconsistent across years, so each dataset's
    variables are individually homologated using DDI metadata (extracted
    via 'daner') to recover variable and category labels where the raw
    .sav files lack them, and the resulting datasets are compiled into
    a single, analysis-ready table per topic. The ingestion pipeline is
    orchestrated with 'targets'.
